Z||000002||GTMike||10-10-2001||09:16 PM||||this swap is more popular than a 350 in a fiero.   advance addapters is the the place to go. i still have my instruction manual around some where.  its pretty easy. <P>i think your going to want to up grade your tranny unless its one from a v6.  the best way to go is to get everything out of a chevy truck.  eng. tranny and t-case. and then make your own t-case cross member.  <P>advance addapters have every thing you need to do the swap||||reg||1
