Z||000005||fiero_buff||10-13-2001||10:23 PM||||Well fool the swap is possible but you might have a little trouble with that 4x4 and the transfer case. My bro is swaping in a 350 into his dodge D-50. What he did was pull a 350 and tranny from a 1979 Monte Carlo (but he doesnt have the 4 wheel drive). So go to a junk yard find a screwed up Chevy truck and pull it from there. ||||reg||1
